# Public site URL used for metadata, sitemap and Open Graph tags.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://marketplusecompony.com

# Optional: every lead (contact form submission or AI ad-generator use) is
# POSTed here as JSON if set (see lib/notify-lead.ts) — point it at a
# Zapier/Make catch hook, a Slack Incoming Webhook, or your own serverless
# function to fan leads out to email/CRM/Slack. Leaves are just logged
# server-side if this isn't set. Never commit the real URL to source control.
# LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Required for the "Generate An Ad Visual With AI" section (see
# app/api/generate-image/route.ts and lib/ai-image.ts). Create a key at
# platform.openai.com — this key is server-side only and is never sent to
# the browser. The feature is hidden behind a lead-capture form and a
# per-IP rate limit, but each generation still costs real money, so keep
# this key private and monitor usage on the OpenAI dashboard.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Required for the AI chat widget (see app/api/chat/route.ts and
# lib/chat.ts). Create a key at console.anthropic.com. Server-side only,
# never sent to the browser. Rate-limited per IP; each reply costs a small
# amount on your Anthropic account.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
